# BITWISE-OPERATORS-NOT-CLASSIFIED (steps/defects.md): the L2 machine profile
# includes bitwise operations (docs/L2_spec_en.md, machine profile), so `a & b`
# is one expression and 6 & 3 is 2. Entry 2, native and walked.
fn: f (int: a; int: b) int
    return: a & b
end: f
int: x f(6, 3)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: x; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
